  "cirque": {
   "name": "Le Chapiteau du Cirque",
   "room_id": "R_adv_manner_01",
   "image": "cirque/cirque.jpg",
   "alt": "The circus big top under red-and-yellow stripes, painted in ink and gouache: a four-tier round wooden stand in the ring. On top a ringmaster cracks his whip as flowers spring from the sawdust, a girl balances a strawberry parfait and a poodle hugs a black boot. Below, a strongman cradles a lion cub, another lifts a baby elephant, a seal claps, and a clown's teapot lid pops off in steam. A clown rides a unicycle, a vet with a stethoscope checks a seal, a bandaged clown drops his ice cream into a puddle, and a blindfolded clown walks into a cream pie. A clown springs out of a trapdoor, a ghost makes the audience jump up, and a lion naps in a boat. On the ring rug clowns queue behind a red wagon and a crowd of clowns squeezes into one tiny car. The open tent flap at the far left leads out to the park; a plank door with a red ball on the left, a door with a paw print on the right, and four coloured doors on a balcony reached by a ladder lead to the other rooms; a striped ticket booth stands at the right.",
